        "name": "NeoTech",
        "email": "andreas@roughedge.se",
        "date": "2026-11-12T11:02:50Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): original icons for tool kinds, tree rows, status badges and actions\n\n#661 slice 2: 31 new SVG masters in assets/ui/svg/, rasterised by\n`cargo xtask icons` like slice 1's operation glyphs.\n\n- Tool kinds (13, one per ToolKind - the checklist's 12 plus the plasma\n  torch): mill tools hang from a solid holder block, lathe tools run\n  left from a solid tool-post block. Wired in the browser's tool\n  library rows, the setup's Tool list and beside the op page's picker.\n- Tree rows (7): setup, part, stock, work offset, fixture, machine,\n  operations folder. Setups/Machine/Operations rows and the ribbon's\n  Setups door wear their own glyphs now.\n- Status badges (4): solid shapes with a knocked-out mark, painted over\n  an op row's glyph; they show what the row text says (BLOCKED or\n  warnings -> warning, else never/ok/stale). OpStatus is unchanged.\n- Actions (7): generate, post, simulate, show, hide, frame all, debug.\n- 11 PNGs no longer used are deleted; 8 Tabler chrome glyphs remain.\n- `cargo xtask icons --sheet` labels each icon with its stem (a 3x5\n  bitmap font of our own); PROCESS_VERSION 26.\n\nRefs #661\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
